CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/bi com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/ProjectileList
	COMMENT A list of projectiles to spawn (ini keys spawnProjectilesOnCreate/OnExplode/OnEndOfLife). Fields: entries (ArrayList of ProjectileSpawnEntry) and the shared static geoIndex (ProjectileSpawnGeoIndex). b(meta, value, key, section, singleOnly) parses "name(*count)(param=value,...)" entries, resolving names through CustomUnitMetadata (ProjectileReference) and accepting spawnChance, maxSpawnLimit, recursionLimit, offsetX/xOffsetAbsolute, offsetY/yOffsetAbsolute, xOffsetRelative, yOffsetRelative, offsetRandomX/Y/XY, offsetHeight, offsetDir, offsetRandomDir (throwing "Unknown parameter 'X'" otherwise); a() returns the total count of projectiles; a(x,y,h,dir,source,out,isPlayer,recursion,world,target) spawns every entry through CustomUnit.a(...).
	FIELD a entries Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/utility/m;
	FIELD b geoIndex Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/bj;
